    <!-- Info sheets -->
    <string name="home_how_body">1. Pick a solar station and a free time slot, up to 7 days ahead.\n\n2. A Grid Operator approves the booking and you get a QR code.\n\n3. Show the QR code at the station. The operator scans it and charging starts.\n\nYou can change or cancel a booking up to 12 hours before the slot.</string>
    <string name="home_why_body">Solar hubs charge your vehicle with clean energy made from sunlight, so every kWh cuts fuel costs and carbon emissions.\n\nSolarGrid shows free slots and the LKR rate per kWh for each station, so you know the cost before you book.</string>
